<title>USA: Washington Post ups qtly div to $1.20/shr.</title>
<headline>Washington Post ups qtly div to $1.20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Post Co said Thursday it had boosted its annual dividend to $4.80 per share from $4.60.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend for the first quarter of 1997 is $1.20 per share, payable February 7, record January 24.</p>
</text>
